{
  "id": "section-school-table",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "school table (d6)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,22,40]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,40,42]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Ancient Egypt exhibit. Fight with a Mummy! L4 Undead, 8 Life, Slow,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,42,110]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Vulnerable to fire. Loot: 2 in 6 chance of 1 roll on the Random Magic\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,110,180]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Item or 3 in 6 chance of 1 Clue (choose before rolling).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,180,237]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,237,239]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Abandoned primary school. Roll on the Children’s Stuff table on\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,239,303]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "p.55. Roll a 2 in 6 chance of an encounter with Witch Children (Roll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,303,372]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "on the Witch Children table).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,372,402]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,402,404]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "This school had a small horticultural garden, or a still working\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,404,469]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "vending machine. Gain 1 Food point.  Roll a 1 in 6 chance of a random\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,469,539]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "encounter from the Possessed table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,539,575]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,575,577]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "School library. Roll a 2 in 6 chance of a random book, and a 2 in 6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,577,645]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "chance of an encounter with d6 zombie children (L2 Undead, Slow,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,645,710]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "damage 1). You may perform a Search roll here after defeating the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,710,776]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "zombie children, if there are any, gaining 1 roll on the Children’s Stuff\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,776,850]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "table (see p. 55) on a success.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,850,882]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,882,884]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Art school. You find art materials (colors, brushes, etc.; they count\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,884,954]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "as a single item if carried). There is a 1 in 6 chance of an encounter\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,954,1025]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "with a random monster. Roll d6 to determine on which table to roll:\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,1025,1093]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1-2 Witch Children, 3 Possessed, 4 Unique Vampire, 5-6 Demonic\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,1093,1156]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Horrors. After rolling for encounters, you have a 2 in 6 chance of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,1156,1223]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "finding a sketchbook. You may ignore it or play event #35 if you pick\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,1223,1293]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "it up. If you do not find the sketchbook, you may perform a Search\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,1293,1360]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll and find 1 Clue on a success.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,1360,1395]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,1395,1397]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Library. You find d3 random books. There’s a 3 in 6 chance of an\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,1397,1462]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "encounter with a witch librarian. Make a L4 Charisma roll. Add +1 if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,1462,1531]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you have the Charisma Skill, +2 if you have Charisma (Expert). On a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,1531,1599]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "success, the Witch Librarian lets you trade one of you objects or 2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,1599,1667]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Food per book desired (from the d3 books above). On a failure, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,1667,1734]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "must fight. Her first attack is a spell (save vs. L5 magic or lose 2 Sanity),\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,1734,1812]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "then she will draw a knife (damage 1). She is L4, 5 Life. If you choose\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,1812,1884]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to Escape from this encounter, the Witch Librarian will cast another\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,1884,1953]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-school-table:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "spell at you (same rules as above) as you flee.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[54,1953,2000]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    54
  ]
}
